### Ledger Service — sample requests (use with IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### List the seeded chart of accounts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts

### Post a balanced journal (payment capture: $100 -> $97 merchant + $3 fee)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "PAYMENT_CAPTURED",
  "externalRef": "PAY-8842",
  "idempotencyKey": "PAY-8842-capture",
  "description": "Capture of PAY-8842",
  "createdBy": "payment-service",
  "lines": [
    { "accountId": "1101", "direction": "DEBIT",  "amountMinor": 9700 },
    { "accountId": "1103", "direction": "DEBIT",  "amountMinor": 300 },
    { "accountId": "2102", "direction": "CREDIT", "amountMinor": 9700 },
    { "accountId": "4101", "direction": "CREDIT", "amountMinor": 300 }
  ]
}

### Balance of the settlement cash account
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/1101/balance

### Trial balance (should be balanced)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trial-balance

### Reverse a journal (replace {id} with the posted journal id)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journals/{id}/reverse
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "TRANSACTION_REVERSED", "createdBy": "refund-service" }

### Place a hold on available balance
POST {{base}}/api/v1/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountId": "1101", "amountMinor": 1000, "reason": "RISK_REVIEW", "externalRef": "PAY-8842" }

### Generate end-of-day snapshots
POST {{base}}/api/v1/snapshots
Content-Type: application/json

{ "asOfDate": "2026-07-19", "snapshotType": "EOD" }
